link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d89be218ac107852\" href=\"?note=d89be218ac107852\" title=\"67-lem-pi-conservative-splitting\">67-lem-pi-conservative-splitting</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Lemmas 7.11 and 7.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>100</span><span>101</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,&lt;_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,&lt;_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_T\">\\(\\mathsf P_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"026bcae68c39ac6f\" href=\"?note=026bcae68c39ac6f\" title=\"67-df-degree-reduction-principle\">67-df-degree-reduction-principle</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathsf P_T\\;\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\mathsf P_T\\;\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T&lt;_Ta&lt;_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷100–101页/PDF111–112页引理11–12，是现有区间不同构定理的可复用判别机制。引理11从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果提取有限见证，再用第5章引理5分裂见证；引理12用递增 r.e. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句集构造不能约化的度。源引理12只显式写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;\\mathbf1_T\">\\(a&lt;\\mathbf1_T\\)</span>；因为底度的单点区间自动满足本定义，得到所列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0_T&lt;a\">\\(\\mathbf0_T&lt;a\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>本次逐页阅读两个来源论证，尚未独立重建其第5–6章全部辅助结果，故保留证明依赖限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-lem-pi-conservative-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"d89be218ac107852","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-lem-pi-conservative-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-reduction-principle","status":"resolved","id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathsf P_T\\;\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in D_T\\;(\\mathbf0_T<_Ta<_T\\mathbf1_T\\land\\neg\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"a<\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0_T<a","display":false}],"bytes":1931,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-116","